      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "If token type is `kCFStringTokenizerTokenNormal`, the `ranges` array has one item filled in with the entire range of the token (if `maxRangeLength` >= 1) and a string taken from the entire token range is added to the `derivedSubTokens` array and the return value is `1`.",
